OL,3,GNEWSAPeople asked for views on blue
OL,4,Abrook pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople affected by a pollution incident
OL,7,Fthat turned a brook bright blue are
OL,8,Fbeing asked to share their experiences
OL,9,Fas part of an ongoing investigation.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency has launched a
OL,12,Fsurvey following the contamination of
OL,13,FLittleham Brook in Exmouth, Devon
OL,14,Fbetween 11 and 25 September.
OL,16,FIt prompted warnings against swimming
OL,17,Fand other water activities at Exmouth
OL,18,Fbeach while officials investigated the
OL,19,Fcause.
OL,21,FThe survey closes on 18 December.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
